The Harder They Fall is a 2021 American Western film directed by Jeymes Samuel (in his
feature directorial debut), who co-wrote the screenplay with Boaz Yakin.

11
01:28:38,823 --> 01:28:44,823
The film stars Jonathan Majors, Idris Elba, Zazie Beetz, Regina King, Delroy Lindo,
Lakeith Stanfield, RJ Cyler, Danielle Deadwyler, Edi Gathegi, and Deon Cole.

12
